> User ccbride (289262)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1048,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1917284,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":288506,"Name":"christine11","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1487672117,"LastPoster":{"Id":283084,"Name":"LeanneP","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283084.jpg?_r=1469546129","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":129,"Preview":{"Id":1917288,"PostDate":1487703317,"PostContent":"\u00a0 Hi Christine. Algonquin Park is beautiful and showcases the very best Mother Nature has to off...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lperrier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.65.225.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431528821,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283084.jpg?_r=1469546129","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeanneP","Id":283084,"Name":"LeanneP","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.219.179.204","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80960,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"491c394b72e6bddc64a5f35a254ea868","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello guys! Our dream destination wedding at Barbados plan has been spoiled due to financial troubles. Jon and I are disappointed, but won&#039;t stay sad and are moving to plan B. It&#039;s still going to be a destination wedding. We are planning a wedding at my favourite place in Canada, Algonquin Park. It&#039;s not going to be a big fat wedding, but a small one with just our families and best buddies. Jon and I go there almost every year and in fact we even have a favourite &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.killarneylodge.com\/algonquin-cabin-rental-prices\/&#039;&gt;waterfront cabin by an Algonquin park cottage&lt;\/a&gt;. We are planning to call them and ask about possibilities of holding a small scale event at their facilities. If everything goes fine, it&#039;ll still be a dream wedding for me. I would like to know if anyone here had their wedding at Algonquin or any provincial park? If someone has done it, can you share your experience and tips.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917284,"PostDate":1487672117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello guys! Our dream destination wedding at Barbados plan has been spoiled due to financial troubles. Jon and I are disappointed, but won't stay sad and are moving to plan B. It's still going to be a destination wedding. We are planning a wedding at my favourite place in Canada, Algonquin Park. It's not going to be a big fat wedding, but a small one with just our families and best buddies. Jon and I go there almost every year and in fact we even have a favourite <a href='http:\/\/www.killarneylodge.com\/algonquin-cabin-rental-prices\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>waterfront cabin by an Algonquin park cottage<\/a>. We are planning to call them and ask about possibilities of holding a small scale event at their facilities. If everything goes fine, it'll still be a dream wedding for me. I would like to know if anyone here had their wedding at Algonquin or any provincial park? If someone has done it, can you share your experience and tips.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrirob@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"162.219.179.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1487671127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"christine11","Id":288506,"Name":"christine11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.65.225.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80960,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f888d36a388f9d5e9c2b7abd72255f0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"christine11\" post=\"1917284\" timestamp=\"1487672117\"]\nHello guys! Our dream destination wedding at Barbados plan has been spoiled due to financial troubles. Jon and I are disappointed, but won&#039;t stay sad and are moving to plan B. It&#039;s still going to be a destination wedding. We are planning a wedding at my favourite place in Canada, Algonquin Park. It&#039;s not going to be a big fat wedding, but a small one with just our families and best buddies. Jon and I go there almost every year and in fact we even have a favourite [url=\"http:\/\/www.killarneylodge.com\/algonquin-cabin-rental-prices\/\"]waterfront cabin by an Algonquin park cottage[\/url]. We are planning to call them and ask about possibilities of holding a small scale event at their facilities. If everything goes fine, it&#039;ll still be a dream wedding for me. I would like to know if anyone here had their wedding at Algonquin or any provincial park? If someone has done it, can you share your experience and tips.[\/quote]\nHi Christine. Algonquin Park is beautiful and showcases the very best Mother Nature has to offer. If we weren&#039;t going to Mexico, I would seriously consider a wedding in tranquil Algonquin Park as well. The Portage Store at km 14.1 has a spacious and rustic restaurant with views out over Canoe Lake. I wonder if the restaurant would be available for rental. I have no advice to offer but wish you the very best as you plan your wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":1917288,"PostDate":1487703317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>christine11, on 21 February 2017 - 02:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello guys! Our dream destination wedding at Barbados plan has been spoiled due to financial troubles. Jon and I are disappointed, but won't stay sad and are moving to plan B. It's still going to be a destination wedding. We are planning a wedding at my favourite place in Canada, Algonquin Park. It's not going to be a big fat wedding, but a small one with just our families and best buddies. Jon and I go there almost every year and in fact we even have a favourite <a href='http:\/\/www.killarneylodge.com\/algonquin-cabin-rental-prices\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>waterfront cabin by an Algonquin park cottage<\/a>. We are planning to call them and ask about possibilities of holding a small scale event at their facilities. If everything goes fine, it'll still be a dream wedding for me. I would like to know if anyone here had their wedding at Algonquin or any provincial park? If someone has done it, can you share your experience and tips.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Christine. Algonquin Park is beautiful and showcases the very best Mother Nature has to offer. If we weren't going to Mexico, I would seriously consider a wedding in tranquil Algonquin Park as well. The Portage Store at km 14.1 has a spacious and rustic restaurant with views out over Canoe Lake. I wonder if the restaurant would be available for rental. I have no advice to offer but wish you the very best as you plan your wedding!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lperrier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.65.225.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431528821,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283084.jpg?_r=1469546129","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeanneP","Id":283084,"Name":"LeanneP","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80960","Title":"Algonquin Destination Wedding Plan.","LastPostDate":1487703317},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
